§ `ss 344D to 344F: restoring the name`
#ASSERT `s 344D(1) an application may be made to the Registrar to restore the name of the company to the register` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 344D(1) an application may be made to the Registrar to restore the name of the company to the register` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 344D(1) an application may be made to the Registrar to restore the name of the company to the register` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 344D(1) an application may be made to the Registrar to restore the name of the company to the register` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 344D(2) the application may be made whether or not the company has in consequence been dissolved` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 344D(2) the application may be made whether or not the company has in consequence been dissolved` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 344D(3) the person may make the application` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 344D(3) the person may make the application` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 344D(3) the person may make the application` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- dissolved on 1 March 2026: 6 years end on 1 March 2032; an application received before the dissolution is read as valid (finding 3)
#ASSERT `s 344D(4) the application is valid as to time` (Date 1 3 2032) (Date 1 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 344D(4) the application is valid as to time` (Date 2 3 2032) (Date 1 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 344D(4) the application is valid as to time` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
